The exact freeform tool description sent by the bridge is copied from
codex-rs/core/src/tools/handlers/apply_patch_spec.rs in that commit. That code
is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The adapter snapshot technique in src/freeform/bridge.ts follows Anionex's
